  "title": "Francesca NDE 7238",
  "date": "June 1993",
  "content": "My fiancé and I were with friends on a rural road in the very early morning hours. He had raced on sport bikes and when he made the suggestion to go to the end of the road or quarter mile to watch the next set of people race, he had then asked me to drive down there. At the time we drove off, it was completely undecided who was next to race. He gave me his helmet, asked me to drive and told me he loved me. We proceeded to drive down the street and as I was moving off to the side of the road, he was telling me something in my left ear. I turned my head to the left side to listen and all I saw was bright light. I'm assuming today that light was the two motorcycles coming towards us. Next thing I am seeing myself at a distance but not ground level. There were people all around me looking down at me. I could see the emergency vehicles and lights for what seemed like a mile in length. I woke up very briefly when I was being put into the ambulance and I remember seeing the flashing lights at the top of the vehicle before going back out of consciousness. I was awake at that point for possibly no more than 5-10 seconds max.",
